Problem 3 — App Click-Through Rate (CTR)

Platform: DataLemur
Concept: Conditional aggregation using CASE WHEN inside COUNT
Task: Calculate the click-through rate per app for the year 2022, defined as (clicks / impressions) × 100.
Logic: Two CASE WHEN expressions inside COUNT separate clicks from impressions in a single pass over the data. Dividing and multiplying by 100 gives the percentage rate per app.


SELECT app_id,
ROUND(100.0 *
COUNT(CASE WHEN event_type = 'click' THEN 1 ELSE NULL END) /
COUNT(CASE WHEN event_type = 'impression' THEN 1 ELSE NULL END), 2) AS ctr_rate
FROM events
WHERE timestamp >= '2022-01-01'
AND timestamp < '2023-01-01'
GROUP BY app_id;
